   "harm": "Seeding prefill candidates with the coinbase forces unnecessary TCP syscalls and prefill branch execution even when no extra transactions are prefilled",
   "hash": "6485556b8baa17aa",
   "history": [
    {
     "at": "2026-09-18T03:33:39+00:00",
     "blocking": false,
     "by": "run:20260918-0314",
     "cause": "rc:3521178456",
     "status": "resolved"
    }
   ],
   "id": "rc:3521178456",
   "kind": "correctness",
   "part": 1,
   "pin": null,
   "question": "",
   "quote": "In that case, the check in net_processing for prefill_candidates.size() > 0 is always true, so we will always go through the prefill path and do all the syscalls even for the current behavior of always prefilling only the coinbase.",
   "request": "",
   "status": "fixed",
   "status_by": {
    "at": "2026-07-14",
    "by": "davidgumberg",
    "id": "rc:3583340609",
    "quote": "Great catch, thank you, I took this by changing the check to be prefill_candidates.size() > 1"
   },
   "status_note": "",
   "type": "objection",
   "url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35558#discussion_r3521178456"
  },
